                                "sense_id": "3acecd89-d87c-30d4-99bc-7db543def0dd",
                                "text": "1696, John Dryden, Epilogue to The Husband His Own Cuckold\nYou laugh not, gallants, as by proof appears,\nAt what his beauship says, but what he wears"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cfd8fa5-ab30-4202-a782-1eb2d927096a",
                                "sense_id": "3acecd89-d87c-30d4-99bc-7db543def0dd",
                                "text": "Do you recollect how I danced his beauship into the ditch? Ah! we were mad fellows then"
                            }
                        ]
